  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:adonai_yodea_machshvot">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/94/11"/><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:adonai_yodea_machshvot/1"/>Adonoy knows the thoughts of man
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:adonai_yodea_machshvot/2"/>that they are vanity.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:milestone unit="verse"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:adonai_yodea_machshvot/3"/>Let Your ear hear
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:adonai_yodea_machshvot/4"/>and Your eyes see
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:adonai_yodea_machshvot/5"/>the prayers of Your people, Israel.
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:kings_1/8/50"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:adonai_yodea_machshvot/6"/>Pardon Your people who sinned to You,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:adonai_yodea_machshvot/7"/>and all their transgressions
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:adonai_yodea_machshvot/8"/>which they transgressed unto You.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:milestone unit="verse"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:adonai_yodea_machshvot/9"/>Grant truth to Jacob,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:adonai_yodea_machshvot/10"/>kindliness to Abraham,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:adonai_yodea_machshvot/11"/>as You have sworn to our fathers
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:adonai_yodea_machshvot/12"/>from the days of old.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:adonai_yodea_machshvot/13"/>Adonoy, Adonoy,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:adonai_yodea_machshvot/14"/>Almighty, Compassionate, and Gracious,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:adonai_yodea_machshvot/15"/>Slow to anger
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:adonai_yodea_machshvot/16"/>and Abounding in kindness and truth.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
